      },
      {
        "h_title": "Hat Yai",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hat Yai",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Large and often rundown hotels catering mainly to business travellers and Malaysian tourists are found all over downtown Hat Yai. Rather than settling on those, seek out one of the far-better options listed below, which aren’t always the most obvious places in town.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "The Aree Hostel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hat Yai",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Opened in 2016, The Aree Hostel combines helpful and personable service with a central location, good common facilities and bunks that are better than most. The cosy hostel occupies a converted shophouse within a 10-minute walk of the train station and nightlife. After being buzzed in, we met friendly owner Pun, a Hat Yai native, and another staffer who also spoke excellent English. They offer... Read our full review of The Aree Hostel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8318",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8318",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of The Aree Hostel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The Aree Hostel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8318",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8318",
                "anchor_text": "The Aree Hostel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Get Guesthouse",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hat Yai",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The small but slick Get Guesthouse opened in 2014 to offer six clean rooms on a quiet downtown lane. Rooms hit with a flash of white and come with air-con, quality linens on firm beds, small LCD TVs on the walls, fridges, desks, coffee/tea facilities and WiFi. The best of them also have balconies with a few potted plants and sliding glass doors, but the small single edition does not have a... Read our full review of Get Guesthouse including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8319",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8319",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Get Guesthouse including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Get Guesthouse",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8319",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8319",
                "anchor_text": "Get Guesthouse"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Wungnoy Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hat Yai",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "After checking out several downtown hotels we settled on the Wungnoy as the best-value option for flashpackers in Hat Yai. Rooms come in separate four-storey buildings on either side of narrow Saeng Chan Road, with the cheapest set in the main property fronted by a large lobby and a Chao Doi coffee shop. Accessed by stairs, all rooms have glass-topped tables on spacious balconies overlooking... Read our full review of Wungnoy Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8320",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8320",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Wungnoy Hotel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Wungnoy Hotel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8320",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8320",
                "anchor_text": "Wungnoy Hotel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Kai Guesthouse",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hat Yai",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "We bumped into the quirky Kai Guesthouse after searching for a hostel that had closed and found it to be a charming option for budget travellers who appreciate more of a homestay-type experience.\nOffering only a few private air-con rooms and a small mixed dorm, all rooms rely on a shared cold-water bathroom set downstairs behind the little convenience store that fronts the street. The room we... Read our full review of Kai Guesthouse including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8323",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/songkhla/hat_yai/all/8323",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Kai Guesthouse including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Kai Guesthouse",
